Subject: [PATCH] Load a worker GitHub token at AgentCore boot for git push and
 PRs.

Self-hosted workers do not inherit Cursor GitHub App tokens. The adapter
now fetches cursor-agentcore-worker-git-token, installs an HTTPS
credential helper, and Terraform grants GetSecretValue plus
CURSOR_GIT_TOKEN_SECRET_ID.
